  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "語言學概論",
    "sub_ename": "INTRODUCTION TO LINGUISTICS",
    "describe_ch": "首先介紹語言學、語音學、音韻學、構詞學、句法學、語義學及語用學的名義及內涵；繼而分析第二語言習得及歷史語言學；終而透過書面及口頭報告，引領學生運用語言學的知識於當下流行語的分析。\r\n\r\n",
    "describe_eh": "First introduces the linguistics, the phonetics, the sound study, the construction word study, the sentence legal science, semantics and the pragmatics name and the connotation; Subsequently analyzes the second language custom and the historical linguistics; The end penetrates written and the oral report, eagerly anticipates the student to utilize the linguistics the knowledge in immediately the catch word analysis.",
